text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08166EC6 {
    "¡No te vayas todavìa!\pQuedaste conmigo en que ayudarìas\na mi hermanito encontrando el Onix.\pVen a nuestra y ofrécele tu ayuda.\p¡Eso le animará muchìsimo!\p¡Arreando!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_0817032A {
    "Ohhh, what am I to do?\pWe were on our walk, PEEKO and I, when\nwe were jumped by an odd thug...\pThe scoundrel made off with my\ndarling PEEKO!\pWrrrooooooaaaar! PEEKO!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081703CF {
    "Nnn... Roar!\pI want to dig that tunnel!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081703F7 {
    "Nnn... Roar!\nWhat’s going on?\pI was digging the tunnel without any\ntools when some goon ordered me out!\pThat tunnel’s filled with POKéMON\nthat react badly to loud noises.\lThey could cause an uproar.\pThat’s why we stopped using heavy\nequipment for tunneling...\pI’m worried that the goon will do\nsomething stupid and startle the\lPOKéMON into an uproar."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170556 {
    "Nnn... Roar!\pThat goofy goon hightailed it out of\nthe tunnel! I can go back to digging!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081705AE {
    "Oh! It’s you!\pYou’re that person who not only helped\nme in PETALBURG WOODS, but also got\lback my stolen package and then even\lgraciously delivered it to SLATEPORT!\pCAPT. STERN informed us that the\npackage arrived, too!\pI thank you very, very much!\pWhy, if I were a rain cloud, I would\nshower you with gratitude and hail\lyou as a hero!\pFor you, the most wonderful TRAINER,\nI bear good news!\pRecently, our company developed a new\nkind of POKé BALL.\pAs a token of our appreciation, this\nis our gift to our wonderful TRAINER!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081707B8 {
    "Our new POKé BALL will be available\nat the POKéMON MART in RUSTBORO.\pPlease do try it out!\nThank you and bye-bye!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_0817082A {
    "Your BAG is jam-packed.\nI can’t give you this REPEAT BALL."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170865 {
    "As a token of our appreciation for\nyour delivering our package, I have a\lgift of a new kind of POKé BALL for our\lmost wonderful TRAINER!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081708EE {
    "I dropped my glasses...\nCan you help me find them?"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170921 {
    "Those glasses!\nMay I see them for a second?"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_0817094D {
    "Hmm...\nThese are BLACKGLASSES.\lThey’re not what I’m looking for...\pMaybe my glasses aren’t around\nhere..."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081709B7 {
    "Hmm...\nI can’t find my glasses anywhere...\lMaybe they’re not around here..."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170A03 {
    "Hmm...\nThese are BLACKGLASSES.\lThey’re not what I’m looking for..."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170A46 {
    "ROUTE 116\nロ RUSTBORO CITY"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170A60 {
    "RUSTURF TUNNEL\n“Linking RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF\p“The tunnel project has been\ncanceled.”"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170AB8 {
    "Cueva de {COLOR 0x0D}Isla SUNBURST"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170ACE {
    "RST"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_08170B7D {
    "TRAINER TIPS\pYour BAG has several POCKETS.\pItems you obtain are automatically\nplaced in the appropriate POCKETS.\pNo TRAINER can afford to be without\na BAG of their own."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBB27 {
    "I use this parasol to ward off this\nfilthy, yucky volcanic ash from my\ldear NUMEL."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBB7A {
    "Huff, huff...\nI am exhausted..."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBB9A {
    "You’re very good at this.\nI must say I’m impressed!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBBCE {
    "Oh, hello, hasn’t it been a while?\nMay I invite you to battle?"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBC0D {
    "Oh, how super!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BBC1C {
    "You’ve remained very good at this.\nI must say I’m impressed!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BCF79 {
    "If the tunnel doesn’t go through, then\nI’ll just go over the top."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BCFBB {
    "Gasp... Gasp...\nLosing made me tired..."
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BCFE3 {
    "It’s no big deal if there’s no tunnel.\nTo a HIKER, mountains are roads!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD377 {
    "I study at school, and I study on the\nway home, too!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD3AC {
    "I’m in shock - I lost?"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD3C3 {
    "Awww, I’ll never become an elegant\nTRAINER like ROXANNE this way!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD405 {
    "I studied a whole lot since I saw you.\nYou must see my achievements!"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD44A {
    "I’m in shock. I lost again?"
}

text Naranja_Mandarin_G00_M31_Text_081BD466 {
    "You’ve beaten ROXANNE?\nI can’t beat you, then. Not yet."
}
